  "description": "Religious-corp adherent-to-adherent multi-stable remittance built on a pre-funded local-currency pool topology under Charter §1.5 anti-commercialization + §2(b) speculative finance prohibition + ADR-2605282100 N2 mKOTO non-transferability + ADR-2605172100 Alt C no-custom-token. Settlement via canonical Base L2 stablecoins (USDC + EURC at R1; +JPYC R2; +KRWO/GBPe/CHFe R3 with Council Lv7+ per pair). NO new token. NOT a commercial MSB (G14+N1+N5). NOT FX trading (G5 const-0 spread). NOT a fiat custodian (G8+N4). NOT Travel-Rule KYC (N8+G10; Adherent SBT IS the KYC). NOT chargeback (G11+N9; chigiri.disputeMediation cooperative-first instead). 14 immutable gates + 12 non-goals + 8 Lexicons + 5 Pregel cells + 1 Solidity scaffold + 1 Python facade + 1 build-time G7 lint hook.",
  "descriptionJa": "Charter §1.5 + §2(b) + ADR-2605282100 N2 + ADR-2605172100 Alt C のもとでの religious-corp adherent 間 multi-stable 送金 substrate。TransferWise の pre-funded local-pool topology を constitutional 制約下に翻訳。Base L2 stablecoin (R1 = USDC+EURC; R2 +JPYC; R3 +KRWO/GBPe/CHFe Council Lv7+ unanimity per pair) のみ settlement、新規 token は鋳造しない。商業 MSB ではなく、FX trading でもなく、fiat custody もせず、Travel Rule にも従わない (SBT が KYC を構造的に置換)。14 不変ゲート + 12 non-goals + 8 Lexicons + 5 Pregel cells + 1 Solidity scaffold + 1 Python facade + 1 build-time G7 lint hook。",
